  "reading": {
    "formula": "i = (int)(((h - offsetDegrees + 360.0f) % 360.0f) / intervalDegrees); face = labels[i] (越界 -> \"未知\"); back = face((h + 180.0f) % 360.0f)",
    "note": "float-to-int 为截断；h∈[0,360) 且 offset<=22.5 时 x+360 恒 >=0，故等价于 floor。坐 = 向+180 后取同一盘面读数。",
    "source": "CompassReadTypeEnum.getFaceText(F) / getBackText(F) 字节码（mem_smali/.../CompassReadTypeEnum.smali 行 7136-7223）"
  },
